OL,3,ARussian dissident Garry Kasparov says
OL,4,AUS warned him of danger to his life
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn exiled Russian opposition figure
OL,7,Fliving in the US says he was warned by
OL,8,FAmerican and Lithuanian security
OL,9,Fservices that his life was in danger.
OL,11,FFormer chess world champion Garry
OL,12,FKasparov said he was one of two
OL,13,Fdissidents told to take precautions,
OL,14,Fwhich he had done.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
